    <!-- Colour is in the path, not in a tint. The bar is set to tint nothing so the bolt can
         stay yellow, and Material answers itemIconTint="@null" by calling
         DrawableCompat.setTintList(icon, null), which wipes a drawable's own android:tint
         too. Anything relying on tint here is erased after inflation, whatever folder the
         colour list lives in. A fill cannot be wiped. -->
